Original Engineering & Architecture by Yhoanes (2026):
  - Pure Android Bionic ARM64 host architecture (com.oc.ide / com.oc.dev,
    10-byte prefix parity, zero PRoot, zero glibc shim, /system/bin/linker64)
    with ForegroundService process supervision and WakeLock management.
  - Zero-friction local authentication handshake (OnboardingSeeder
    service-stable.json + /api/pair -> /auth/connect/:code -> WebView
    CookieManager session injection) and Workbox ServiceWorker cache guard.
  - Native Extensions -> Plugins catalog & instant hot-reload integration
    (POST /api/location/reload, opencode.json MCP & skills.paths sync) for
    10 native ARM64 MCP suites (Craft Anything + Ghidra 12.1.4, AGY Video Gen,
    AGY Video Studio, Game Studio 2D/3D, Unity Studio Android, GitHub MCP,
    AGY ADB Bridge, Chrome DevTools MCP, Android CLI, and Science Suite).
  - Native ARM64 Rust multicall runtime (oc-box v0.3.0: 4-thread parallel pkg
    manager, inotify oc-daemon scheduler, SIMD oc-fix-paths rewriter, and
    native oc-notify Android tray IPC) plus 16 KB-aligned libagy-go-dns.so.
  - Gradle-free 11-phase deterministic Android APK build pipeline (aapt,
    javac, D8, zipalign, apksigner), Shizuku (rish) elevated shell integration,
    and in-app GitHub Releases OTA updater.

